[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   step_063: Bidirectional boundary validation + rotation-per-kick residual.
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   Every Phase-3 step measures the catalogue's orig->fut periapsis-direction
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   discrepancy d_of.  step_042 verified that a real N-body integration
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   reproduces the catalogue's energy kicks (rho=0.98), and step_062 showed
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   the published Planet Nine cannot inject the observed rotation.  This
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   step measures what STANDARD dynamics predicts for the rotation itself,
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   and -- critically -- evaluates the boundary solutions in the same
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   BARYCENTRIC frame the catalogue uses for its original/future orbits.
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   For each class-1 CODE comet (identical selection to step_040/042/062)
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   the osculating elements at the catalogued perihelion epoch are
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   converted to a state and integrated through Sun + planetary-system
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   barycentres (DE440s, REBOUND/IAS15) TWICE:
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   backward until barycentric |r| = 250 AU  -> analogue of the catalogue's
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   "original" solution
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   forward  until barycentric |r| = 250 AU  -> analogue of the "future"
[2026-09-21 14:40:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 063]   solution
